#: src/ui/power.rs:278
msgid "GNOME's power settings weren't found. They need GNOME Settings Daemon."
msgstr ""
"No se encontraron los ajustes de energía de GNOME. Necesitan GNOME Settings "
"Daemon."

#: src/ui/power.rs:284
msgid "Show Battery Percentage"
msgstr "Mostrar porcentaje de batería"

#: src/ui/power.rs:284
msgid "Shows the percentage next to the battery icon in the top bar"
